msgid "In an Estonian statement the verb usually comes second. Start with a time or a place, and the person moves after the verb: <0>Täna lähen ma Tartusse</0>, today I’m going to Tartu."
msgstr "In an Estonian statement the verb usually comes second. Start with a time or a place, and the person moves after the verb: <0>Täna lähen ma Tartusse</0>, today I’m going to Tartu."

